# bumpii's own output and state. The config is the blunt one — your usagePaths
# and every tool you track. A run's --json is barely behind it: every report
# embeds the config entry it was judged from, and `overview --json` lists the
# usagePaths that have gone missing, absolute and all. None of it belongs in a
# repo, this one or anyone else's.
tools.json
sources.json
bumpii.json
bumpii-*.json
*.bumpii.json
.bumpii/

# Written by the CI test step; the log is read back in the same step.
test-output.txt
